CPUs built for the age of AI.
专为 AI 时代打造的 CPU。

605
00:51:54,520 --> 00:52:00,230
All of the CPUs until now were created for people.
以往所有的 CPU 都是为人类设计的。

606
00:52:00,280 --> 00:52:02,670
We were the users.
我们是使用者。

607
00:52:02,720 --> 00:52:04,399
We were the users.
我们是使用者。

608
00:52:04,449 --> 00:52:06,310
We were the renters.
我们是租户。

609
00:52:06,360 --> 00:52:12,190
The way we use CPUs, we live in a world counted by seconds.
我们使用 CPU 的方式，让我们生活在一个以秒为单位的世界。

610
00:52:12,240 --> 00:52:21,110
The way we rent CPUs in the cloud, each one of them more you can more CPU cores you have, the more you can rent.
我们在云端租用 CPU 时，核心越多，能租用的就越多。

611
00:52:21,160 --> 00:52:30,230
The economics of the old the use case of the old CPU and the economics of the old CPU fundamentally different than agents.
旧 CPU 的使用场景及其经济模式，与智能体的根本不同。

612
00:52:30,280 --> 00:52:33,830
Agents are impatient.
智能体没有耐心。

