00:52:33,880 --> 00:52:35,835
They don't live in a world that is in seconds.
他们生活在一个以纳秒为单位的世界里，而不是以秒为单位。

614
00:52:35,885 --> 00:52:39,110
They live in a world that's in nanoseconds.
他们生活在一个以纳秒为单位的世界里。

615
00:52:39,160 --> 00:52:45,510
When it uses a tool, it wants the response time to be as fast as possible.
当它使用工具时，希望响应时间尽可能快。

616
00:52:45,560 --> 00:52:50,230
When it access database, it has to come back as soon as possible.
当它访问数据库时，必须尽快返回结果。

617
00:52:50,280 --> 00:52:58,670
Every moment that the agent is waiting keeps it from going to the next step, the next step, the next step.
智能体每多等待一瞬，就错失一次推进到下一步的机会，错失下一次，错失下下一次。

618
00:52:58,720 --> 00:53:07,710
It is vital that we make the CPUs as low latency as possible, as interactive as possible.
我们必须将CPU的延迟降到最低，交互性做到极致，这一点至关重要。

619
00:53:07,760 --> 00:53:12,030
So, we created Vera CPU for the age of AI.
因此，我们为AI时代打造了Vera CPU。

