The first way, of course, is Vera Rubin for thinking.
第一种用途，当然是用于Vera Rubin的思考。

622
00:53:23,480 --> 00:53:28,270
And inside the Vera Rubin rack, there already two CPUs.
在Vera Rubin机架内部，已经配备了两颗CPU。

623
00:53:28,320 --> 00:53:34,950
As you know, we are building and selling millions of Vera Rubins.
如你所知，我们正在制造并销售数百万台Vera Rubins。

