00:53:35,000 --> 00:53:38,084
We have sold millions of Grace Blackwells.
我们已经售出数百万台Grace Blackwell。

625
00:53:38,134 --> 00:53:42,190
Nvidia already is one of the largest CPU makers in the world.
英伟达已经是全球最大的CPU制造商之一。

626
00:53:42,240 --> 00:53:46,230
Vera In the Vera Rubin rack are two CPUs.
在Vera Rubin机架中配备了两颗CPU。

