00:53:54,360 --> 00:53:58,390
dealing with all of the software that runs in the rack.
处理机架中运行的所有软件。

629
00:53:58,440 --> 00:54:05,150
We also have the Grace BlueField that is used for security and isolation.
我们还配备了Grace BlueField，用于安全和隔离。

630
00:54:05,200 --> 00:54:15,230
The Vera compute is used for the harness, the orchestration of the AI models, tool use, accessing the database.
Vera计算单元用于智能体运行框架、AI模型的协调、工具调用以及数据库访问。

631
00:54:15,280 --> 00:54:20,150
And the data servers are right here, Vera BlueField.
数据服务器就在这里，Vera BlueField。

632
00:54:20,200 --> 00:54:26,507
The fastest storage fastest storage servers, the fastest storage system the world has ever made.
最快的存储服务器，最快的存储系统，世界上迄今为止制造的最快存储系统。

633
00:54:26,557 --> 00:54:34,990
And the reason why this is so vital is because agents are accessing memory, accessing memory so incredibly fast.
这之所以至关重要，是因为智能体正在以极快的速度访问内存。

634
00:54:35,040 --> 00:54:46,630
These systems, the storage server and the CPUs are now the critical path of the most expensive part of the data center.
这些系统，包括存储服务器和CPU，现在已成为数据中心最昂贵部分的关键路径。

635
00:54:46,680 --> 00:54:50,430
This is the most expensive for a good reason.
这确实非常昂贵，但有充分的理由。

636
00:54:50,480 --> 00:54:57,350
The economics the economics of the AI factory is tokens.
AI工厂的经济核心是词元。

637
00:54:57,400 --> 00:55:00,110
And the tokens are created here.
词元就在这里生成。

638
00:55:00,160 --> 00:55:05,150
And so of course you want to manufacture and generate as many tokens as possible.
因此你当然希望尽可能多地制造和生成词元。

639
00:55:05,200 --> 00:55:07,531
This is where you put all of your economics.
这里是你放置所有经济模型的地方。

640
00:55:07,581 --> 00:55:11,110
And this has to not be in the way.
而且它必须不成为障碍。

641
00:55:11,160 --> 00:55:21,492
And so Vera CPU has great pressure on the Vera on the CPU architecture, which is the reason why we built a brand new architecture from the ground up.
因此 Vera CPU 在 CPU 架构上承受着巨大压力，这也是我们从零开始打造全新架构的原因。

642
00:55:21,542 --> 00:55:24,110
A CPU the world has never seen before.
这是世界前所未见的 CPU。

643
00:55:24,160 --> 00:55:26,470
We call it Vera.
我们称它为 Vera。

644
00:55:26,520 --> 00:55:30,430
This is CPU for agents.
这是为智能体设计的 CPU。

645
00:55:30,480 --> 00:55:34,390
All the CPUs of the past we built for humans.
过去我们打造的所有 CPU 都是为人类设计的。

646
00:55:34,440 --> 00:55:37,350
This CPU is built for agents.
这款 CPU 是为智能体打造的。

647
00:55:37,400 --> 00:55:39,910
Well, there four things to keep in mind.
好，有四点需要牢记。

648
00:55:39,960 --> 00:55:41,870
The four takeaways.
这四个要点。

649
00:55:41,920 --> 00:55:52,030
The first takeaway is that the instructions per clock of Vera has to be incredibly good because we need the latency to be short.
第一个要点是，Vera 的每时钟指令数必须非常出色，因为我们需要保持低延迟。

650
00:55:52,080 --> 00:56:02,350
We need the processing time, single threaded performance, not throughput, single threaded performance has to be world-class, absolutely the best.
我们需要的是处理时间，单线程性能，而不是吞吐量，单线程性能必须达到世界级，绝对是最顶尖的。

651
00:56:02,400 --> 00:56:09,386
Single threaded performance, which is the reason why the IPC, the instructions per clock of Vera is so high.
单线程性能，正是 Vera 每时钟指令数（IPC）如此高的原因。

652
00:56:09,436 --> 00:56:11,432
It's the highest in the world.
这是全球最高的。

653
00:56:11,482 --> 00:56:16,150
10 instructions fetch, decoded, and executed per clock.
每时钟周期可获取、解码并执行 10 条指令。

654
00:56:16,200 --> 00:56:17,790
Number one.
第一。

655
00:56:17,840 --> 00:56:19,630
Number two.
第二。

656
00:56:19,680 --> 00:56:27,150
The bandwidth necessary to move data in and out for the CPU has to be utterly world-class.
CPU 数据进出所需的带宽必须是绝对的世界级水平。

657
00:56:27,200 --> 00:56:30,670
The second thing is bandwidth per core.
第二点是每核心带宽。

658
00:56:30,720 --> 00:56:33,870
The third is just bandwidth, period.
第三点就是带宽本身。

659
00:56:33,920 --> 00:56:43,430
We're moving Remember, I said earlier, agentic systems is fundamentally disaggregated and distributed.
我们在移动，还记得我之前说过的吗？代理式系统本质上是解耦且分布式的。

660
00:56:43,480 --> 00:56:45,738
Disaggregated and distributed.
解耦且分布式的。

661
00:56:45,788 --> 00:56:51,790
When computing is disaggregated and distributed, networking becomes the problem.
当计算被解耦并分布式部署时，网络就变成了核心问题。

662
00:56:51,840 --> 00:57:02,230
Therefore, we have to move the data around as fast as possible between the CPU cores and between the CPU and the storage, the CPU and the GPU.
因此，我们必须尽可能快速地在 CPU 核心之间、CPU 与存储之间、CPU 与 GPU 之间传输数据。

663
00:57:02,280 --> 00:57:09,350
The bandwidth around the system and inside the CPU core has to be utterly world-class.
系统内外的带宽以及 CPU 核心内部的带宽必须达到世界顶级水平。

664
00:57:09,400 --> 00:57:14,810
This is the first CPU that's been built a long time that is literally at theoretical
这是很久以来第一款真正逼近理论极限的 CPU。

665
00:57:14,860 --> 00:57:21,592
limits with a fabric that connects all of the CPU cores that is speed of light.
它采用了一种连接所有 CPU 核心的架构，其传输速度接近光速。

666
00:57:21,642 --> 00:57:24,670
3.6 terabytes per second.
3.6 太字节每秒。

667
00:57:24,720 --> 00:57:26,630
No chiplet tax,
没有芯片小片税，

668
00:57:26,680 --> 00:57:36,362
no chip boundary crossings because we need to have everything because the CPU cores are talking to each other with extremely high bandwidth.
无需跨越芯片边界，因为我们需要所有部件紧密协作，CPU 核心之间必须以极高的带宽通信。

669
00:57:36,412 --> 00:57:39,184
They're not rented core per core per core.
它们不是按核心租赁的。

670
00:57:39,234 --> 00:57:41,790
They're all working together.
它们都在协同工作。

671
00:57:41,840 --> 00:57:45,007
The cross-sectional bandwidth of Vera is off the charts.
Vera 的横向带宽高得惊人。

672
00:57:45,057 --> 00:57:49,150
It's the first one to be PCI Express Gen 6.
它是首款支持 PCI Express Gen 6 的处理器。

673
00:57:49,200 --> 00:57:56,830
It is also the first one to have LPDDR5 with 1.2 terabytes per second.
它也是首个配备 LPDDR5、带宽高达每秒 1.2 太字节的芯片。

674
00:57:56,880 --> 00:58:06,750
Three times two to three times the bandwidth of the highest performance CPUs on the outside three times the bandwidth on the inside.
外部最高性能 CPU 带宽的三倍，内部带宽更是其三倍。

675
00:58:06,800 --> 00:58:11,550
The bandwidth per core and the bandwidth period is world class.
每核心带宽和带宽周期均属世界顶尖水平。

