01:40:17,952 --> 01:40:22,577
However, in physical AI, we are absolutely the world's best.
然而，在物理 AI 领域，我们绝对是全球最顶尖的。

1198
01:40:22,627 --> 01:40:24,674
I am so proud of the team for doing this.
我为团队所取得的成就感到无比自豪。

1199
01:40:24,724 --> 01:40:28,350
This is the foundation model for all of your work.
这是你们所有工作的基础模型。

1200
01:40:28,400 --> 01:40:34,550
Whenever you want to create a robot, whenever you want to create a factory robot or a robot that works in a factory,
无论你何时想制造一台机器人，无论你想制造工厂机器人，或是在工厂中工作的机器人，

1201
01:40:34,600 --> 01:40:45,470
any kind of robot there in that involves physical world, you now have a companion, a Cosmos 3 that can understand and reason.
任何涉及物理世界的机器人，现在你都有一个伙伴，一个能理解并推理的 Cosmos 3。

1202
01:40:45,520 --> 01:40:47,150
It can generate.
它可以生成。

1203
01:40:47,200 --> 01:40:49,017
It can simulate in the loop.
它可以在闭环中进行模拟。

1204
01:40:49,067 --> 01:40:51,369
It can even be the policy itself.
它甚至可以成为策略本身。

1205
01:40:51,419 --> 01:40:54,949
It is on the top of leaderboards all over the all over the world.
它在全球各类排行榜上均位居榜首。

1206
01:40:54,999 --> 01:40:58,923
I am incredibly proud of Cosmos and today we're announcing Cosmos 3.
我对 Cosmos 深感自豪，今天我们将正式发布 Cosmos 3。

1207
01:40:58,973 --> 01:41:01,790
Let's take a look.
让我们来看一看。

1208
01:41:01,840 --> 01:41:05,270
The real world is infinite and unpredictable.
现实世界是无限且不可预测的。

1209
01:41:05,320 --> 01:41:10,830
Physical AI needs data, but real-world data is impossible to scale.
物理 AI 需要数据，但现实世界的数据无法实现规模化。

1210
01:41:10,880 --> 01:41:14,630
For physical AI, compute is data.
对于物理 AI 来说，计算即数据。

1211
01:41:14,680 --> 01:41:23,070
This is Cosmos, an open frontier omnimodel for physical AI built on a new mixture of transformers architecture.
这是 Cosmos，一个基于全新混合 Transformer 架构构建的物理 AI 开放前沿全能模型。

1212
01:41:23,120 --> 01:41:29,205
Pixels, action, sound and language flow into the autoregressive transformer which reasons,
像素、动作、声音和语言流入自回归 Transformer，它能够进行推理，

1213
01:41:29,255 --> 01:41:35,110
plans and instructs the diffusion transformer which generates what comes next.
规划并指导扩散变换器生成接下来的内容。

1214
01:41:35,160 --> 01:41:39,590
Developers post-train Cosmos across embodiments and use cases.
开发者在多种具身形态和应用场景中对宇宙模型进行后训练。

1215
01:41:39,640 --> 01:41:49,990
As a VLM, Cosmos watches the physical world, understands what's happening, describing scenes, and flagging what matters.
作为视觉-语言-动作模型，宇宙模型观察物理世界，理解正在发生的事，描述场景，并标记重要信息。

1216
01:41:50,040 --> 01:41:58,510
As a world model, Cosmos generates physics-accurate synthetic video from an image, text, or video.
作为世界模型，宇宙模型能从一张图像、一段文字或一段视频生成物理上准确的合成视频。

1217
01:41:58,560 --> 01:42:03,790
As a simulator, Cosmos closes the loop for policy training and evaluation.
作为模拟器，宇宙模型为策略训练和评估实现闭环。

1218
01:42:03,840 --> 01:42:13,350
And as the foundation of NVIDIA Omniverse, an action-conditioned world model, Cosmos predicts the future frame by frame.
作为英伟达 Omniverse 的基础，一种动作条件化的世界模型，宇宙模型逐帧预测未来。

1219
01:42:13,400 --> 01:42:17,670
Post-train Cosmos, and it becomes a world action model.
对宇宙模型进行后训练后，它便成为一种世界动作模型。

1220
01:42:17,720 --> 01:42:20,590
Perceiving, reasoning, planning,
感知、推理、规划，

1221
01:42:20,640 --> 01:42:30,390
generating actions for robots of every kind, for everything that moves.
为各类机器人、所有移动物体生成动作。

1222
01:42:30,440 --> 01:42:37,790
A new kind of data, a new kind of teacher, generated by compute.
一种新型数据，一种新型教师，由计算生成。

1223
01:42:37,840 --> 01:42:38,454
Cosmos,
宇宙模型，

1224
01:42:38,504 --> 01:42:45,615
the foundation for developers of
开发者的基石。

1225
01:42:45,665 --> 01:42:55,190
the age of physical AI.
物理 AI 的时代。

1226
01:42:55,240 --> 01:43:00,430
This takes data plus compute gives you AI.
这需要数据加上计算，才能得到 AI。

1227
01:43:00,480 --> 01:43:04,910
Now that we have AI, compute is data.
现在我们有了 AI，计算就是数据。

1228
01:43:04,960 --> 01:43:08,565
And so, use Cosmos 3, train a whole bunch of AI models.
所以，使用 Cosmos 3，训练大量 AI 模型。

1229
01:43:08,615 --> 01:43:10,853
Cosmos is such an incredible open model system.
Cosmos 是一个令人难以置信的开放模型系统。

1230
01:43:10,903 --> 01:43:12,519
It's exactly the same as Nemotron.
它与 Nemotron 完全相同。

1231
01:43:12,569 --> 01:43:13,430
We open model.
我们开放模型。

1232
