I mentioned PCs, but in the future, it'll be robots and satellites and base stations and factories, in the cloud, on prem, at the edge.
我提到了个人电脑，但未来它还将运行在机器人、卫星、基站、工厂、云端、本地部署以及边缘设备上。

1361
01:53:42,074 --> 01:53:50,058
This pattern, agentic AI system, this agentic computing pattern will be replicated in computers all over.
这种代理式 AI 系统，这种代理式计算模式，将在全球各地的计算机中被复制。

1362
01:53:50,108 --> 01:53:54,470
How we think about the personal computer will very likely change.
我们对个人电脑的认知很可能会发生改变。

1363
01:53:54,520 --> 01:53:58,528
I want to thank all of you for your partnership, your friendship.
我想感谢大家一直以来的合作与友谊。

1364
01:53:58,578 --> 01:54:01,639
We couldn't be here without everything that we do together.
没有我们共同的努力，我们不可能走到今天。

1365
01:54:01,689 --> 01:54:05,830
I am so proud of how you've been so successful this last year.
我为你们在过去一年取得的巨大成功感到无比自豪。

1366
01:54:05,880 --> 01:54:09,124
The next year is going to be even more.
明年将会更加精彩。

1367
01:54:09,174 --> 01:54:09,790
I have one
我还有一件事

1368
01:54:09,840 --> 01:54:21,216
more thing for you.
要告诉你们。

1369
01:54:21,266 --> 01:54:32,070
Let's take a look.
我们来看一下。

1370
01:54:32,120 --> 01:54:36,270
You ready, Taiwan?
台湾准备好了吗？

1371
01:54:36,320 --> 01:54:37,870
Let's do this.
开始吧。

1372
01:54:37,920 --> 01:54:40,590
The keynote's coming at Computex.
主题演讲将在 Computex 上举行。

1373
01:54:40,640 --> 01:54:42,710
Jensen showed the world what's next.
黄仁勋向世界展示了未来。

1374
01:54:42,760 --> 01:54:44,948
Useful AI has arrived.
实用的 AI 已经到来。

1375
01:54:44,998 --> 01:54:47,339
Agents working by your side.
智能体在你身边工作。

1376
01:54:47,389 --> 01:54:52,950
But in case you missed things we said today, we're going to break it all down for you, Taipei.
但如果你错过了我们今天说的内容，我们将在台北为你一一解析。

1377
01:54:53,000 --> 01:54:55,069
Agents used to be misunderstood.
智能体过去常被误解。

1378
01:54:55,119 --> 01:54:57,472
Only movie stars had them in Hollywood.
只有好莱坞的电影明星才有它们。

1379
01:54:57,522 --> 01:55:02,528
Now we all got teams making dreams come true, building companies from living rooms.
现在我们每个人都有团队，让梦想成真，从客厅里创办公司。

1380
01:55:02,578 --> 01:55:04,486
But they need so much compute.
但它们需要大量的计算能力。

1381
01:55:04,536 --> 01:55:05,550
We hear you.
我们听到了。

1382
01:55:05,600 --> 01:55:07,750
That's why we created Vera.
这就是为什么我们创造了维拉。

1383
01:55:07,800 --> 01:55:09,628
Rubin's law, the show is true.
鲁宾定律，这节目是真的。

1384
01:55:09,678 --> 01:55:12,190
The cheapest tokens coming through.
最便宜的词元正在通过。

1385
01:55:12,240 --> 01:55:14,282
10 times faster inference heaven.
推理速度提升十倍，简直是天堂。

1386
01:55:14,332 --> 01:55:17,230
More special agents than 007.
特工数量比007还多。

1387
01:55:17,280 --> 01:55:19,910
BlueField keeps agents memory true.
蓝场保持特工记忆的准确性。

1388
01:55:19,960 --> 01:55:22,230
Now, let's talk about it, CPU.
现在，我们来谈谈它，CPU。

1389
01:55:22,280 --> 01:55:24,430
50% faster, that's outrageous.
快了50%，这太离谱了。

1390
01:55:24,480 --> 01:55:25,430
Not for Vera.
这不是为维拉准备的。

1391
01:55:25,480 --> 01:55:26,830
It's built for agents.
它专为智能体而生。

1392
01:55:26,880 --> 01:55:29,254
NVLink Fusion blends ASICs smartly.
NVLink融合智能地整合了ASIC。

1393
01:55:29,304 --> 01:55:32,270
Everyone's welcome to the NVLink party.
欢迎所有人参加 NVLink 派对。

1394
