Nemotron 3 Ultra leave the run.
Nemotron 3 Ultra 开始运行。

1398
01:55:40,000 --> 01:55:41,970
Five x faster work gets done.
五倍快的工作效率得以实现。

1399
01:55:42,020 --> 01:55:44,462
NeMo Guardrails keeps the guardrails right.
NeMo 护栏确保护栏始终到位。

