01:55:44,512 --> 01:55:47,070
OpenShell keeps the sandbox tight.
OpenShell 保持沙箱严密。

1401
01:55:47,120 --> 01:55:49,710
Your code migrated and reviewed.
你的代码已完成迁移并经过审查。

1402
01:55:49,760 --> 01:55:52,670
All before this song is through.
在这首歌结束前全部完成。

1403
01:55:52,720 --> 01:55:56,245
AI is a five layer cake for revenue.
AI 是收入的五层蛋糕。

1404
