Turning computing into synthetic feet.
将计算转化为合成的足部动作。

1418
01:56:26,680 --> 01:56:29,230
Alpamayo reasons through.
阿尔帕马约通过推理来思考。

1419
01:56:29,280 --> 01:56:31,710
Understand flows like people do.
理解流动，如同人类一样。

1420
01:56:31,760 --> 01:56:34,270
Who is how they learn to move.
他们如何学习移动，就决定了他们是谁。

1421
01:56:34,320 --> 01:56:36,630
Learning skills and finding groove.
学习技能，找到节奏。

1422
01:56:36,680 --> 01:56:39,350
You'll need trees powered by those.
